                <pb facs="0601" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg519"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/2427.</note>
                <head>[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic">October 18,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The practically unanimous election of Madero is insured by the now definitely
                    ascertained result of the general elections of Sunday; also the election of Pino
                    Suarez by a substantial majority. This insures complete carrying out of the
                    revolutionary program.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
